WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:30.340
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:33.578
=Against The Current=

00:01:33.579 --> 00:01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:36.920
=Episode 9=
(This drama does not correspond)

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:45.940
(Ten Thousand Volumes Library)

00:01:47.799 --> 00:01:48.920
Where is Scholar Shouyi?

00:01:49.256 --> 00:01:50.920
Old Master said
he wanted to look around.

00:01:51.159 --> 00:01:51.959
I'll go get him.

00:01:52.319 --> 00:01:52.680
No need.

00:01:53.464 --> 00:01:54.392
I'll find him myself.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.039
Scholar Shouyi.

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:57.199
The Zhongfu Hexagram.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.800
The second yang line.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.280
Very good.

00:03:18.479 --> 00:03:19.879
Taken from heaven and earth,

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.599
and returned to heaven and earth.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.280
Sir,

00:03:23.352 --> 00:03:24.776
what does this hexagram mean?

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.479
A gentleman stays within his home.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.520
When he speaks,

00:03:31.319 --> 00:03:34.639
if his words are good, they will
find accord a thousand miles away,

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.400
let alone nearby.

00:03:37.919 --> 00:03:39.199
He stays within his home.

00:03:39.199 --> 00:03:40.360
When he speaks,

00:03:41.439 --> 00:03:45.560
if his words are unkind, they will
meet opposition a thousand miles away,

00:03:46.039 --> 00:03:48.639
let alone nearby.

00:03:49.199 --> 00:03:50.479
I don't understand.

00:03:52.319 --> 00:03:53.280
Sir,

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.840
what does that mean?

00:03:55.199 --> 00:03:56.759
When you're at home

00:03:57.599 --> 00:03:58.840
and say kind things,

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.840
even people a thousand
miles away will respond in kind,

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.599
let alone those nearby.

00:04:05.319 --> 00:04:06.319
When you're at home

00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:08.000
and say unkind things,

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.400
even people a thousand
miles away will oppose you,

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.879
let alone those nearby.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.960
I still don't understand.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.160
Good girl.

00:04:20.439 --> 00:04:22.079
Say you know when you know,

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:23.959
and say you don't when you don't.

00:04:24.839 --> 00:04:25.639
Good.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:29.560
My young friend,

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.519
do you understand now?

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.360
Be careful with your words.

00:04:36.519 --> 00:04:37.800
Say more kind things

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.839
and build goodwill.

00:04:38.839 --> 00:04:40.160
Don't speak carelessly,

00:04:40.279 --> 00:04:42.000
or you'll face the consequences.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:43.920
I understand.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.800
Who taught you

00:04:46.879 --> 00:04:48.839
yarrow-stalk divination?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.360
I was often ill as a child.

00:04:52.439 --> 00:04:53.759
When I stayed at a nunnery,

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:56.260
I watched the master perform divinations
and learned a little.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.639
Unfortunately, I only learned
how to cast a hexagram,

00:04:58.759 --> 00:04:59.879
not how to interpret one.

00:05:09.639 --> 00:05:10.480
Fengtai.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.680
Young Master.

00:05:17.959 --> 00:05:19.000
I came across

00:05:19.279 --> 00:05:22.639
two young friends trying
their hand at yarrow-stalk divination.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.160
Grass, old, and sun

00:05:30.319 --> 00:05:32.519
together form
the character for "yarrow".

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.160
It piqued my interest,

00:05:34.399 --> 00:05:37.959
so I asked them to divine

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.360
the matter at hand.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.920
Old Master Lin runs his household well.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.519
Even the maids here
are quite perceptive.

00:05:49.439 --> 00:05:50.639
You flatter us, Scholar Shouyi.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.000
The banquet is about to begin.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:55.839
Let's go.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.920
My young friends,

00:06:04.959 --> 00:06:08.360
if you ever come to Qixia Mountain,

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.272
(Qixia Academy, Fang Yu)
bring my calling card

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.800
and come find me at Qixia Academy.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:15.879
Thank you, sir.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:33.560
Why are you here?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.040
Young Madam wanted to look around

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.800
and told us to wait for her here.

00:06:40.008 --> 00:06:41.830
Young Madam sent me
back to get her shoes.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.959
I couldn't find them, so I hurried back.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.759
Xiaolian said Young Madam
told us to wait here,

00:06:46.959 --> 00:06:49.040
so Xiaolian and I practiced
yarrow-stalk divination

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:50.360
while waiting for Young Madam.

00:06:59.144 --> 00:07:00.856
There's no need
to wait for Young Madam.

00:07:01.519 --> 00:07:02.639
Go find First Madam

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:04.480
and follow her instructions.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:06.879
Yes.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.380
♪See the long road winding on♪

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:23.860
♪As all the noise falls silent♪

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:29.300
♪The keepsake rests against my chest
as I wait with lowered eyes♪

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.140
♪See how the passing years wear away♪

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.700
♪As even deep affection fades♪

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:40.380
♪The past is like fallen leaves
scattered into dust♪

00:07:48.519 --> 00:07:49.279
Fengtai.

00:07:57.959 --> 00:07:58.759
Lanxiang.

00:07:59.519 --> 00:08:00.480
How did you know

00:08:00.639 --> 00:08:02.879
Scholar Fang would join us
in yarrow-stalk divination?

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:09.700
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
the rain turns to mud♪

00:08:10.456 --> 00:08:12.504
(For great matters,
use tortoise divination.)

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.392
(For small matters,
use yarrow divination.)

00:08:15.439 --> 00:08:17.160
(Tortoise shells are used to divine,)

00:08:17.656 --> 00:08:19.720
(while yarrow stalks
are used to cast hexagrams.)

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:23.000
These yarrow stalks
are firm yet flexible.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.000
In a thousand years,
they grow three hundred stalks.

00:08:26.759 --> 00:08:28.000
Their roots have grown old,

00:08:28.856 --> 00:08:30.744
so they are said
to tell good fortune from bad.

00:08:45.679 --> 00:08:46.879
You little rascal.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.440
Fang Shouyi begged me to teach him,

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:51.679
but I never did.

00:08:52.679 --> 00:08:54.399
Yet you fell asleep listening to me.

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.960
All divination
has its roots in the Book of Changes.

00:09:01.759 --> 00:09:04.840
I thought I'd teach you the basics,

00:09:05.112 --> 00:09:06.680
so the next time you returned home,

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.440
you could play yarrow-stalk divination

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.799
with your friends.

00:09:11.039 --> 00:09:12.720
You'd beat them every time.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.759
But instead, you're dozing off.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.480
Grandfather,

00:09:18.759 --> 00:09:19.440
I'll learn.

00:09:20.279 --> 00:09:21.039
Really?

00:09:27.039 --> 00:09:27.679
(These are)

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.000
(fifty yarrow stalks.)

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.100
♪See how the passing years wear away♪

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.180
♪As even deep affection fades♪

00:09:34.639 --> 00:09:36.720
When I used to
deliver meals to Rongbao Pavilion,

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:39.600
I once heard some scholar mention

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:43.039
that Scholar Fang was devoted
to the Book of Changes.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.864
He especially admired
King Wen of Zhou and Confucius,

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:48.000
who were both
skilled in yarrow-stalk divination.

00:09:48.519 --> 00:09:50.080
I saw some yarrow by the vat,

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.799
so I thought I had nothing to lose

00:09:51.928 --> 00:09:54.024
and pulled out
some dried stalks to give it a try.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.760
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.039
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

00:10:28.424 --> 00:10:30.120
Lucao, who was
slacking off in the kitchen,

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.159
has already been tied up.

00:10:31.559 --> 00:10:33.720
We'll trade her to merchants
from the north for furs.

00:10:34.296 --> 00:10:37.096
But there are still two maids
who have been staying with my sister,

00:10:37.159 --> 00:10:40.000
Xu Lanxiang and Du Xiaolian.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.759
Those two maids

00:10:42.799 --> 00:10:44.799
have already caught
Fang Shouyi's attention,

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.639
and he even gave them his calling card.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.559
It's already become
a favorite story at the banquet.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.799
If they suddenly disappeared,

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.399
wouldn't word of it

00:10:56.519 --> 00:10:59.200
draw even more attention?

00:11:00.639 --> 00:11:03.559
But what if
they find out about my sister...

00:11:03.799 --> 00:11:04.639
Idiot.

00:11:06.399 --> 00:11:10.600
Lin Jinqi has killed people
with his own hands.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.159
He's far more ruthless than you.

00:11:12.759 --> 00:11:15.000
If those two maids notice anything,

00:11:15.519 --> 00:11:18.519
Lin Jinqi will deal
with them sooner or later.

00:11:18.799 --> 00:11:20.240
Why dirty our own hands?

00:11:23.519 --> 00:11:24.639
You're right, Father.

00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:28.039
We lost a son-in-law today,

00:11:28.639 --> 00:11:30.639
but gained Fang Shouyi's help.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.000
At least we'll have something

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.448
to tell Old Master in the capital.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.240
Now we still have
Qian Shaoze to deal with.

00:11:44.799 --> 00:11:45.519
Master.

00:11:45.679 --> 00:11:47.759
Qian... Qian Shaoze escaped.

00:11:50.279 --> 00:11:50.960
Useless.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.856
You couldn't even
keep watch over one man!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.000
We can't exactly report this
to the authorities now.

00:11:59.279 --> 00:12:00.120
Good that he escaped.

00:12:02.759 --> 00:12:05.080
After all, he holds the rank
of a scholar.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.000
It would've been rather inconvenient

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.639
to deal with him inside the residence.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:12.360
Then, Father, you mean...

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:15.600
Even if he's running away,

00:12:15.679 --> 00:12:17.960
is he supposed to run away on foot?

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.919
A carriage, a horse, or a boat...

00:12:22.559 --> 00:12:23.960
Which one doesn't cost money?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.399
I'll go find my sister.

00:12:28.679 --> 00:12:29.720
She must know

00:12:29.799 --> 00:12:31.240
where Qian Shaoze keeps his money.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:04.840
Hyah!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.240
If you want to live,

00:13:41.639 --> 00:13:43.639
hand over all your money.

00:13:44.879 --> 00:13:45.600
Sirs...

00:13:47.639 --> 00:13:48.480
Sirs...

00:13:48.799 --> 00:13:50.000
I'll give you all my money.

00:13:50.328 --> 00:13:51.550
I only ask that you show mercy.

00:13:51.559 --> 00:13:52.799
Please spare my life.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.279
Young Master Qian,

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.120
you've been
making usurious loans for years.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.080
How could this be all you have?

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:12.279
Who are you?

00:14:12.679 --> 00:14:13.519
Who are you?

00:14:14.279 --> 00:14:14.919
Who are you?

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:15.919
Who are you?

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:33.559
I'll...

00:14:33.759 --> 00:14:35.200
I'll give you the money.

00:14:35.799 --> 00:14:36.320
Here.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.559
Please spare my life.

00:15:25.399 --> 00:15:26.799
Just as you said,

00:15:27.279 --> 00:15:28.879
we had men watch outside the bank,

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.919
and sure enough, Qian Shaoze showed up

00:15:30.919 --> 00:15:33.120
in disguise to exchange
his money for silver.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.160
We followed him
all the way out of the city

00:15:35.399 --> 00:15:37.200
until we found a deserted mountain road.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:39.000
Only then did we get our chance.

00:15:41.279 --> 00:15:43.360
It's exactly 4,000 taels, not one short.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.639
Now that you're back home,

00:15:46.088 --> 00:15:48.264
you don't have anywhere
to spend money anyway.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.399
So this money...

00:15:51.159 --> 00:15:52.519
I'll keep it safe for you for now.

00:15:55.144 --> 00:15:56.200
We had an agreement.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.960
I told you how to catch Qian Shaoze.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.559
You get Qian Shaoze,

00:16:02.952 --> 00:16:03.944
and I get the money.

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:08.840
Yes.

00:16:09.919 --> 00:16:11.440
I'm only keeping it safe for you.

00:16:11.759 --> 00:16:13.519
I never said I'd take your silver.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.240
Why are you acting like this?

00:16:16.559 --> 00:16:17.360
You'd better not.

00:16:26.399 --> 00:16:26.879
Master.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.660
(Separation Agreement)

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.440
You shameless wretch.

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:34.600
You've utterly disgraced

00:16:34.879 --> 00:16:36.519
this entire family.

00:16:39.224 --> 00:16:40.610
This is your separation agreement.

00:16:40.799 --> 00:16:41.799
Keep it safe.

00:16:47.399 --> 00:16:48.279
What about my dowry

00:16:48.559 --> 00:16:50.080
and the silver in my room?

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:50.919
You wretch!

00:16:50.919 --> 00:16:51.720
Master!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.960
Old Master Lin already said

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.960
your dowry
and everything in Zhichun Hall

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.720
that wasn't purchased
with the Lin family's common funds,

00:16:58.799 --> 00:17:00.200
whether people or possessions,

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.536
will all be returned
with you to the Zhao family.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:04.839
You wretch!

00:17:04.839 --> 00:17:05.400
Move.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:05.799
Master.

00:17:05.799 --> 00:17:06.440
Move!

00:17:08.599 --> 00:17:09.920
Because of your scandal,

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.559
we've been running around all day,

00:17:13.839 --> 00:17:15.160
smiling and bowing,

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:19.240
doing everything
we could to cover it up.

00:17:19.759 --> 00:17:21.000
Now that we're back,

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.640
you don't even ask whether
we're hungry, tired, or cold.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.119
All you talk about is money!

00:17:30.359 --> 00:17:31.240
If I asked,

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.119
wouldn't you still
think I've disgraced you?

00:17:40.232 --> 00:17:42.184
You want to marry me off
as soon as possible?

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:47.079
To some old man who could benefit you,

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:50.519
so I can be his second wife?

00:17:50.559 --> 00:17:52.400
I'll beat you to death, you wretch!

00:17:52.759 --> 00:17:54.559
Calm down, Master.

00:17:54.599 --> 00:17:55.240
Master!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.640
I'll beat you to death!

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:58.400
In this world,

00:17:59.944 --> 00:18:01.960
men who speak sweetly
but harbor cruel intentions,

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.079
and parents who keep
saying it's for my own good,

00:18:06.664 --> 00:18:07.920
as far as I'm concerned,

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.319
aren't as dependable
as cold, hard silver

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:12.680
that can't even speak.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.599
I'll beat you to death!

00:18:13.599 --> 00:18:14.839
Master, take care of yourself.

00:18:14.839 --> 00:18:15.680
You wretch!

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.160
My sister is talking nonsense.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:17.799
Besides,

00:18:17.799 --> 00:18:19.319
why would you lower yourself

00:18:19.319 --> 00:18:20.359
to argue with a woman?

00:18:20.359 --> 00:18:22.359
Xingtang, apologize to Father at once!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.519
You useless woman!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:27.799
Look at her!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.000
Look how badly you've

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.359
spoiled this wretch!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.960
Master, please calm down.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:44.680
Let me tell you this.

00:18:45.799 --> 00:18:47.640
I'm your father.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.799
I gave you life,

00:18:52.359 --> 00:18:53.720
and I raised you.

00:18:54.839 --> 00:18:56.079
Never mind your silver

00:18:56.119 --> 00:18:57.400
and your dowry.

00:18:57.559 --> 00:18:58.720
Even you

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.400
belong to the Zhao family.

00:19:00.799 --> 00:19:03.319
Only what the Zhao family
chooses to give you

00:19:04.039 --> 00:19:05.599
is truly yours.

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.440
Never mind your silver.

00:19:09.039 --> 00:19:11.160
Even if I beat you to death today,

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:15.039
the world would only
call you disobedient and unfilial.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.079
Go.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.599
Take her silver

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.039
and her dowry

00:19:21.448 --> 00:19:23.144
and put them into the family estate.

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:23.960
Store them away.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.000
Master.

00:19:42.279 --> 00:19:43.079
Master!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.480
The Three Obediences and Four Virtues
have always bound me,

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.160
and I have no power to resist.

00:19:51.839 --> 00:19:52.920
But today...

00:19:54.759 --> 00:19:55.559
Master,

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.200
either

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.759
you beat this unfilial daughter of yours

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.039
to death right here

00:20:04.559 --> 00:20:07.000
and take back the life
you and First Madam gave me,

00:20:10.519 --> 00:20:11.160
or...

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.319
My dowry

00:20:16.119 --> 00:20:17.400
and my silver

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.240
must be returned in full!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.279
Otherwise,

00:20:30.319 --> 00:20:32.240
as long as I still draw breath,

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.119
I'll tell everyone.

00:20:38.319 --> 00:20:39.400
Everyone!

00:20:42.119 --> 00:20:44.160
I'll tell them why
Grand Secretary Zhao's

00:20:45.784 --> 00:20:47.550
eldest granddaughter
cannot have children,

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:54.720
and why the Zhao
and Lin families agreed to a separation!

00:21:01.279 --> 00:21:02.599
Didn't you tell me

00:21:05.519 --> 00:21:06.960
that we must stand together as one?

00:21:10.504 --> 00:21:12.240
That when one prospers, we all prosper,

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.640
and when one suffers, we all suffer?

00:21:20.599 --> 00:21:22.240
If I have to suffer,

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.000
then no one

00:21:25.624 --> 00:21:27.544
in the Zhao family
will have an easy life.

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:49.799
You've gone mad.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.119
Madwoman.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:55.839
You're a madwoman.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:00.640
And let me tell you this.

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:03.920
If it weren't for Old Master,

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:06.400
today,

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:09.279
I'd kill you with my own hands.

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:26.559
Please calm down.

00:22:42.279 --> 00:22:43.039
Careful.

00:22:56.728 --> 00:22:58.200
Everything here has been inventoried.

00:22:58.200 --> 00:22:59.272
You can move it out now.

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:11.224
These were brought from the Zhao family

00:23:11.230 --> 00:23:12.970
by the eldest daughter
of the Zhao family.

00:23:13.032 --> 00:23:15.510
They'll now be returned
to the Zhao family with her dowry.

00:23:16.079 --> 00:23:16.559
Yes.

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.920
These were purchased by
the eldest daughter of the Zhao family

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.559
with the family's common funds.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.279
They'll now be sold,

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:28.520
and the proceeds
will go back into the common funds.

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:30.759
Two of you, move these out.

00:23:39.784 --> 00:23:40.920
Is that about everything?

00:23:41.119 --> 00:23:41.960
Pretty much.

00:24:15.880 --> 00:24:17.000
What should we do?

00:24:21.519 --> 00:24:22.680
Let's clean up.

00:24:24.079 --> 00:24:25.400
Whether we stay or leave,

00:24:26.312 --> 00:24:28.160
there's no harm
in keeping everything clean.

00:24:29.519 --> 00:24:30.640
Lanxiang is right.

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:33.160
Instead of waiting around anxiously,

00:24:33.912 --> 00:24:35.400
we might as well find something to do.

00:24:37.528 --> 00:24:38.728
I'll fetch some water.

00:25:11.848 --> 00:25:12.680
The water is cold.

00:25:12.880 --> 00:25:13.759
I'll do the washing.

00:25:37.799 --> 00:25:38.599
Baogai,

00:25:39.279 --> 00:25:40.519
when we worked in the tea room,

00:25:41.000 --> 00:25:42.480
you looked after me very well.

00:25:43.519 --> 00:25:44.519
I don't remember

00:25:45.079 --> 00:25:46.039
anything else.

00:25:52.720 --> 00:25:54.599
We were all just trying to survive.

00:26:02.280 --> 00:26:03.270
Let's do this together.

00:26:05.240 --> 00:26:05.920
All right.

00:26:10.559 --> 00:26:11.440
I'll use this cloth.

00:26:12.700 --> 00:26:17.980
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

00:26:22.079 --> 00:26:22.759
I'll wipe this.

00:26:23.079 --> 00:26:23.880
You wipe here.

00:26:23.880 --> 00:26:24.400
All right.

00:26:24.780 --> 00:26:27.780
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

00:26:27.780 --> 00:26:31.060
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

00:26:31.060 --> 00:26:36.780
♪Yet their proud spirit
fades with wind and snow♪

00:26:36.780 --> 00:26:40.020
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

00:26:40.020 --> 00:26:43.140
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

00:26:43.540 --> 00:26:49.020
♪Watching the old
and new take turns in this world♪

00:26:53.319 --> 00:26:53.960
Here.

00:26:54.319 --> 00:26:55.880
First Madam, watch your step.

00:27:22.640 --> 00:27:23.839
First Madam is here.

00:27:31.944 --> 00:27:33.384
- First Madam.
- First Madam.

00:27:49.039 --> 00:27:49.960
Gantang

00:27:52.240 --> 00:27:53.720
will be promoted to second-class maid.

00:27:59.200 --> 00:28:00.319
Thank you, First Madam.

00:28:02.279 --> 00:28:05.480
Together with Xiaolian,
Lanxiang, and Baogai,

00:28:06.119 --> 00:28:07.720
that makes four second-class maids.

00:28:09.480 --> 00:28:11.319
Add eight more third-class maids.

00:28:13.039 --> 00:28:14.720
Have Madam Han come help,

00:28:15.319 --> 00:28:16.759
and assign a cook

00:28:16.839 --> 00:28:18.920
and a few honest women
for the heavy chores.

00:28:19.839 --> 00:28:20.880
That should be enough staff

00:28:21.319 --> 00:28:22.680
for Zhichun Hall.

00:28:23.370 --> 00:28:25.500
But finding a first-class maid
who can manage things

00:28:25.519 --> 00:28:27.759
and is both loyal and dependable

00:28:28.160 --> 00:28:29.839
won't be easy

00:28:30.319 --> 00:28:31.799
on such short notice.

00:28:32.720 --> 00:28:34.319
Jinqi has already made arrangements.

00:28:35.279 --> 00:28:38.599
That boy always thinks ahead.

00:28:38.880 --> 00:28:40.440
As his mother,

00:28:40.799 --> 00:28:43.519
I'm both relieved and concerned for him.

00:28:44.119 --> 00:28:45.519
Young Master is simply being filial.

00:28:46.079 --> 00:28:48.160
You have nothing
to worry about, First Madam.

00:28:49.400 --> 00:28:50.319
First Madam.

00:28:50.880 --> 00:28:51.759
She's here.

00:29:09.640 --> 00:29:10.319
First Madam.

00:29:10.319 --> 00:29:12.780
(Yuchan)

00:29:14.279 --> 00:29:15.240
First Madam just said

00:29:15.250 --> 00:29:17.990
Young Master had already arranged
for someone to manage Zhichun Hall.

00:29:18.000 --> 00:29:20.440
I was wondering who it could be

00:29:20.680 --> 00:29:22.880
that both Young Master
and First Madam could trust.

00:29:23.759 --> 00:29:25.119
So it's Yuchan.

00:29:26.632 --> 00:29:28.790
Thank you, First Madam,
for making an exception for me.

00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:30.160
Only then

00:29:30.680 --> 00:29:32.000
was I able to come back.

00:29:33.960 --> 00:29:35.119
Now that you're back,

00:29:35.640 --> 00:29:36.920
manage this courtyard well

00:29:37.559 --> 00:29:38.880
and serve Young Master properly.

00:29:42.680 --> 00:29:44.559
I will do my utmost

00:29:44.880 --> 00:29:46.559
and not let First Madam down.

00:29:51.920 --> 00:29:53.400
First Madam, rest assured.

00:29:53.799 --> 00:29:55.200
With Yuchan and me here,

00:29:55.400 --> 00:29:56.480
we'll make sure Zhichun Hall

00:29:56.480 --> 00:29:57.880
is properly taken care of

00:29:58.000 --> 00:30:00.160
so Young Master
can be as comfortable as before.

00:30:04.680 --> 00:30:06.359
But let me make this clear first.

00:30:06.968 --> 00:30:08.720
Young Master
is busy with official duties.

00:30:09.279 --> 00:30:10.480
If any of you are unruly

00:30:10.480 --> 00:30:11.599
or careless in your work

00:30:11.880 --> 00:30:13.440
and cause trouble in Zhichun Hall,

00:30:14.519 --> 00:30:16.720
I will not let it slide.

00:30:29.359 --> 00:30:30.599
You four stay.

00:30:31.319 --> 00:30:33.519
The rest of you follow
Madam Han's arrangements.

00:30:36.880 --> 00:30:38.160
You few, come with me.

00:30:45.920 --> 00:30:47.119
My name is Yuchan.

00:30:47.799 --> 00:30:50.599
I was originally a second-class maid
serving First Madam.

00:30:51.279 --> 00:30:53.599
First Madam thought
I handled things reliably,

00:30:53.759 --> 00:30:55.240
so she assigned me to Young Master

00:30:55.559 --> 00:30:57.359
as the senior maid of Zhichun Hall.

00:30:58.640 --> 00:31:01.720
Later, when Young Lady Zhao
managed the household,

00:31:03.079 --> 00:31:04.240
she arranged for me to marry

00:31:04.240 --> 00:31:06.799
the foolish son of Shopkeeper Liu
from the rice shop.

00:31:08.119 --> 00:31:11.279
A few days ago,
Shopkeeper Liu's family was sold off.

00:31:11.352 --> 00:31:13.400
I separated from my husband
and left the household,

00:31:13.680 --> 00:31:16.000
then begged First Madam
and Young Master for mercy

00:31:16.088 --> 00:31:18.216
and was allowed
to return to work at Zhichun Hall.

00:31:18.599 --> 00:31:20.079
I'm a few years older than all of you.

00:31:20.519 --> 00:31:24.319
From now on,
you can just call me Yuchan.

00:31:25.519 --> 00:31:26.720
- Yuchan.
- Yuchan.

00:31:29.720 --> 00:31:30.880
On my way here,

00:31:30.880 --> 00:31:32.480
Madam Han told me about all of you.

00:31:33.279 --> 00:31:35.519
But I still want to hear it
from you yourselves.

00:31:35.720 --> 00:31:36.640
What can you do?

00:31:36.776 --> 00:31:37.830
What are you capable of?

00:31:38.200 --> 00:31:39.519
What do you want to do?

00:31:49.640 --> 00:31:52.519
If you've managed to survive
under Young Lady Zhao until now,

00:31:52.712 --> 00:31:54.790
each of you must have
your own way of getting by.

00:31:55.880 --> 00:31:58.039
Things are different now.

00:31:58.279 --> 00:32:01.279
Young Master
is the only master in this courtyard,

00:32:01.839 --> 00:32:03.920
and First Madam
is in charge of the household.

00:32:06.759 --> 00:32:08.920
You should all go back
and think carefully

00:32:09.519 --> 00:32:11.359
about how you want to live from now on.

00:32:12.759 --> 00:32:13.960
Once you've figured it out,

00:32:14.440 --> 00:32:15.480
come and tell me.

00:32:16.519 --> 00:32:17.319
Yuchan,

00:32:18.200 --> 00:32:19.400
I'm not very clever.

00:32:19.519 --> 00:32:21.200
What if I can't figure it out?

00:32:22.880 --> 00:32:24.119
Among the girls in Zhichun Hall

00:32:24.200 --> 00:32:26.799
who were sent away by Young Lady Zhao,

00:32:27.519 --> 00:32:28.759
I wasn't the only one.

00:32:29.799 --> 00:32:32.599
Yet now I'm the only one
who escaped that misery

00:32:32.799 --> 00:32:34.480
and managed to return to Zhichun Hall.

00:32:35.200 --> 00:32:36.400
Why do you think that is?

00:32:38.319 --> 00:32:40.119
Because First Madam and Young Master

00:32:41.599 --> 00:32:42.960
think you're capable.

00:32:50.480 --> 00:32:51.880
You're all still young,

00:32:52.504 --> 00:32:55.080
so you don't yet understand
how hard life is for women,

00:32:55.720 --> 00:32:57.279
especially women like us

00:32:57.720 --> 00:32:59.400
who serve as maids.

00:33:00.920 --> 00:33:03.640
Our lives are even harder
than those of other women.

00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:07.559
If you want more choices

00:33:08.240 --> 00:33:09.440
and more freedom,

00:33:10.680 --> 00:33:11.759
you need to be capable,

00:33:12.519 --> 00:33:14.039
to be able to serve your masters well

00:33:14.480 --> 00:33:15.799
and earn their regard.

00:33:16.960 --> 00:33:17.960
If you're fortunate,

00:33:18.312 --> 00:33:20.200
you may not only
receive your master's favor

00:33:20.200 --> 00:33:21.400
and regain your indenture,

00:33:22.039 --> 00:33:23.720
but also build a life of your own.

00:33:25.359 --> 00:33:26.480
Even with average luck,

00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:28.640
you can still follow your heart

00:33:29.480 --> 00:33:30.640
and choose whom to marry.

00:33:31.839 --> 00:33:33.039
And even if you're unlucky,

00:33:33.960 --> 00:33:35.200
like me,

00:33:35.559 --> 00:33:37.839
and end up suffering
for years after marrying a fool,

00:33:38.312 --> 00:33:39.976
you can still receive your master's help

00:33:40.024 --> 00:33:42.280
to separate from your husband
and leave his household.

00:33:46.160 --> 00:33:47.279
From today onward,

00:33:48.039 --> 00:33:49.720
we all belong to Zhichun Hall.

00:33:50.319 --> 00:33:51.920
We live under the same roof.

00:33:52.720 --> 00:33:54.240
I want a fresh start

00:33:54.839 --> 00:33:56.200
and a better life than before.

00:33:58.799 --> 00:34:02.480
I hope all of you
can have a better life, too.

00:34:14.060 --> 00:34:17.420
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

00:34:38.920 --> 00:34:40.519
Baogai and I are all settled in.

00:34:40.639 --> 00:34:41.400
What about you?

00:34:42.079 --> 00:34:43.280
We're all settled in, too.

00:34:43.280 --> 00:34:44.472
We were just about to sleep.

00:34:53.639 --> 00:34:54.480
Gantang,

00:34:54.960 --> 00:34:56.360
why don't the two of us

00:34:56.360 --> 00:34:57.800
go ask Yuchan

00:34:57.960 --> 00:35:00.679
to let us switch rooms?

00:35:02.400 --> 00:35:03.199
No.

00:35:03.576 --> 00:35:05.496
I want to share a room
with Lanxiang, too.

00:35:13.599 --> 00:35:14.880
This really feels like a dream.

00:35:14.952 --> 00:35:15.920
When we first came here,

00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:17.300
I wondered how long it would take

00:35:17.310 --> 00:35:19.000
before we could
become second-class maids

00:35:19.010 --> 00:35:19.920
like Lucao and Jinzhan.

00:35:19.920 --> 00:35:20.639
Xiaolian.

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:25.519
Don't bring up the past again.

00:35:32.280 --> 00:35:34.440
I didn't mention it
in front of anyone else.

00:35:34.880 --> 00:35:36.639
I'm only talking
about it among ourselves.

00:35:39.079 --> 00:35:40.000
You.

00:35:42.400 --> 00:35:43.440
Don't mention it again.

00:35:53.590 --> 00:35:55.160
Outsiders don't know the details

00:35:55.272 --> 00:35:57.432
of Young Master
and Young Madam's separation,

00:35:57.512 --> 00:35:58.872
but those of us in this courtyard

00:35:58.920 --> 00:36:00.190
all know something wasn't right.

00:36:00.920 --> 00:36:03.400
I won't ask what happened
at the Zhao Residence that day.

00:36:03.559 --> 00:36:05.719
And none of you
should mention it to anyone,

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:07.304
or you'll only invite trouble.

00:36:09.440 --> 00:36:11.079
Gantang is looking out for us.

00:36:12.199 --> 00:36:13.000
Xiaolian.

00:36:13.559 --> 00:36:15.360
The people and things from the past

00:36:15.760 --> 00:36:17.480
are best forgotten completely.

00:36:19.840 --> 00:36:20.800
I understand.

00:36:21.039 --> 00:36:23.400
Even when it's just us in private,

00:36:23.400 --> 00:36:24.519
I won't mention it again.

00:36:26.199 --> 00:36:27.039
You.

00:36:27.039 --> 00:36:28.519
You may not be very quick-witted,

00:36:28.519 --> 00:36:30.159
but at least you listen to advice.

00:36:31.480 --> 00:36:32.800
You two are clever.

00:36:33.599 --> 00:36:37.119
Tell me what Yuchan meant when she said

00:36:37.119 --> 00:36:38.960
the more capable we are,

00:36:39.079 --> 00:36:40.400
the more freedom we can earn.

00:36:44.760 --> 00:36:48.239
Four third-class maids share one room.

00:36:48.920 --> 00:36:51.960
Two second-class maids share one room.

00:36:52.760 --> 00:36:55.480
A first-class maid
gets a room to herself.

00:36:56.280 --> 00:36:58.920
If the three of us
were still third-class maids,

00:36:59.079 --> 00:37:01.199
then four of us
would have to share one room.

00:37:01.400 --> 00:37:02.840
Then we definitely couldn't

00:37:02.840 --> 00:37:04.119
talk as freely as we do now.

00:37:04.599 --> 00:37:07.599
I think that's what freedom means.

00:37:11.400 --> 00:37:13.679
Then what does it mean
to be more capable

00:37:13.800 --> 00:37:16.480
and have more choices?

00:37:20.360 --> 00:37:21.480
Third-class maids

00:37:22.000 --> 00:37:23.440
receive five hundred coins a month.

00:37:23.719 --> 00:37:24.719
Second-class maids

00:37:24.720 --> 00:37:26.180
receive eight hundred coins a month.

00:37:26.239 --> 00:37:27.199
First-class maids

00:37:27.199 --> 00:37:28.760
receive one tael of silver a month.

00:37:29.440 --> 00:37:31.159
When you earn
five hundred coins a month,

00:37:31.280 --> 00:37:33.400
you want to send the money home

00:37:33.440 --> 00:37:34.984
and can't bear to spend any on candy.

00:37:35.400 --> 00:37:37.559
When you earn
one tael of silver a month,

00:37:37.880 --> 00:37:39.760
you can still do what you did before

00:37:39.760 --> 00:37:41.199
and send five hundred coins home.

00:37:41.240 --> 00:37:43.096
Then you'll still
have five hundred coins left.

00:37:43.440 --> 00:37:44.800
You can buy candy if you want,

00:37:44.840 --> 00:37:46.239
or flowers if you want.

00:37:46.320 --> 00:37:47.639
You'll have many more choices.

00:37:49.400 --> 00:37:50.440
Exactly.

00:37:50.440 --> 00:37:52.728
Back when I was promoted
to second-class maid...

00:37:56.760 --> 00:37:57.559
Lanxiang.

00:37:58.000 --> 00:37:59.599
Now that Young Madam is gone,

00:37:59.599 --> 00:38:01.719
First Madam won't make us
bear children, will she?

00:38:03.559 --> 00:38:04.559
Of course not.

00:38:04.800 --> 00:38:07.159
Let's just focus on being maids.

00:38:10.000 --> 00:38:10.880
Why?

00:38:12.079 --> 00:38:12.880
Right.

00:38:13.800 --> 00:38:14.599
Why?

00:38:17.320 --> 00:38:19.119
A family like the Lin family

00:38:19.239 --> 00:38:20.480
cares greatly about propriety.

00:38:21.639 --> 00:38:23.840
They would certainly take
a wife before any concubines.

00:38:24.440 --> 00:38:26.360
Before, there was a Young Madam,

00:38:26.880 --> 00:38:28.519
but she had no children for many years.

00:38:28.880 --> 00:38:30.239
Taking concubines or chambermaids

00:38:30.360 --> 00:38:31.599
wouldn't have been improper.

00:38:32.199 --> 00:38:33.639
Now that Young Madam is gone,

00:38:34.039 --> 00:38:37.000
First Madam will surely
wait until things settle down

00:38:37.039 --> 00:38:38.719
before finding Young Master a new wife.

00:38:39.559 --> 00:38:40.400
Otherwise,

00:38:40.400 --> 00:38:42.480
respectable families
who cherish their daughters

00:38:42.480 --> 00:38:44.680
would be reluctant
to marry them into this family.

00:38:50.280 --> 00:38:51.519
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

00:38:51.719 --> 00:38:52.960
That's a relief.

00:38:53.760 --> 00:38:54.679
Quick, cover it up.

00:38:56.639 --> 00:38:57.880
Then from now on,

00:38:58.000 --> 00:39:00.760
I'm going to work hard
to become a first-class maid.

00:39:01.559 --> 00:39:03.440
You little monkey
really know how to aim higher.

00:39:03.679 --> 00:39:04.599
You once said

00:39:04.800 --> 00:39:06.639
you'd be satisfied if you could become

00:39:06.639 --> 00:39:07.679
a second-class maid.

00:39:08.199 --> 00:39:09.000
And now?

00:39:09.000 --> 00:39:11.336
You're actually dreaming
of becoming a first-class maid.

00:39:12.239 --> 00:39:14.599
Everyone should hope

00:39:14.599 --> 00:39:16.559
that each year
will be better than the last.

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:18.719
Even if that hope never comes true,

00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:21.199
it's still nice to dream about it.

00:39:24.000 --> 00:39:25.119
It's so cold outside.

00:39:25.120 --> 00:39:26.792
I'll sleep here tonight.

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:28.140
The three of us can sleep together.

00:39:28.150 --> 00:39:29.920
All right.

00:39:32.020 --> 00:39:35.300
(Jinling Ministry of Revenue Office)

00:39:44.280 --> 00:39:45.760
Everyone says Lin Fengtai is shrewd.

00:39:46.440 --> 00:39:47.719
I think he's a fool.

00:39:48.280 --> 00:39:50.039
Young Lady Zhao is beautiful,

00:39:50.184 --> 00:39:52.232
and she's
Grand Secretary Zhao's granddaughter.

00:39:52.679 --> 00:39:54.239
Yet he would even separate

00:39:54.400 --> 00:39:55.320
from a wife like her.

00:39:55.480 --> 00:39:57.030
Even if she couldn't bear him children,

00:39:57.159 --> 00:39:58.400
he could have taken concubines.

00:39:58.488 --> 00:39:59.800
(Dai Rong, Sixth-Rank)
How do you know

00:39:59.810 --> 00:40:01.270
Lin Fengtai wanted the separation?

00:40:01.464 --> 00:40:04.590
(Registrar, Jinling Ministry of Revenue)
Maybe Young Lady Zhao insisted on it.

00:40:04.920 --> 00:40:06.159
That's impossible.

00:40:06.880 --> 00:40:08.760
The Lin family
is a prominent Jiangnan family,

00:40:09.199 --> 00:40:11.159
and Lin Fengtai
is young and accomplished.

00:40:11.224 --> 00:40:12.776
If she remarries after a separation,

00:40:12.872 --> 00:40:15.110
she'll never find another man
with such an outstanding

00:40:15.119 --> 00:40:16.440
family background and character.

00:40:16.800 --> 00:40:18.000
Why is that impossible?

00:40:19.000 --> 00:40:22.079
If Young Lady Zhao would rather
separate and remarry,

00:40:22.920 --> 00:40:27.480
then Lin Fengtai is most likely
all show and no substance.

00:40:33.639 --> 00:40:34.679
Someone!

00:40:34.679 --> 00:40:35.440
Congyi.

00:40:47.159 --> 00:40:47.960
Lin Fengtai!

00:40:48.200 --> 00:40:50.920
How dare you let your subordinate
openly assault an official!

00:40:51.079 --> 00:40:51.920
Registrar Dai,

00:40:52.376 --> 00:40:53.992
shall we report this to the authorities?

00:40:58.840 --> 00:41:01.840
Why would I stoop
to arguing with a rough soldier?

00:41:02.559 --> 00:41:03.360
Besides,

00:41:03.440 --> 00:41:05.400
Fengtai and I
are both officials of the court.

00:41:06.039 --> 00:41:07.280
For your sake, I'll let this go.

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:12.159
What brings you here today, Fengtai?

00:41:12.159 --> 00:41:12.760
Come.

00:41:12.760 --> 00:41:13.599
Fengtai, please sit.

00:41:13.760 --> 00:41:15.620
Quick. Bring
Assistant Commander Lin some tea.

00:41:15.639 --> 00:41:16.559
No need for tea.

00:41:17.320 --> 00:41:19.119
I'm only here to ask you, Registrar Dai,

00:41:19.320 --> 00:41:20.840
with the year-end almost upon us

00:41:20.880 --> 00:41:22.119
and the offices about to close,

00:41:22.519 --> 00:41:23.760
and after two rounds of snow,

00:41:24.920 --> 00:41:26.840
why haven't we seen
any of the padded coats,

00:41:27.320 --> 00:41:29.400
combat boots, and fur hats

00:41:29.832 --> 00:41:31.800
the Ministry of Revenue promised us?

00:41:32.039 --> 00:41:32.880
Could it be that

00:41:34.920 --> 00:41:37.400
(Rations)
the rats in this office ate them all?

00:41:38.110 --> 00:41:40.296
(Salaries)
The padded coats,

00:41:40.296 --> 00:41:41.920
combat boots, and fur hats

00:41:42.152 --> 00:41:44.150
were supposed
to have been distributed long ago.

00:41:44.376 --> 00:41:46.408
But the Grand Secretariat
just changed the rules.

00:41:47.159 --> 00:41:49.400
Winter supplies
for the Garrisons in Jinling

00:41:49.719 --> 00:41:51.400
must now be dispatched from Huguang.

00:41:51.752 --> 00:41:53.230
As soon as I received the directive,

00:41:53.240 --> 00:41:54.540
I urged the local authorities
along the route

00:41:54.552 --> 00:41:56.180
to recruit laborers
to haul the supplies.

00:41:56.190 --> 00:41:57.384
But with all this heavy snow,

00:41:57.512 --> 00:41:59.000
supplying them has been difficult.

00:41:59.320 --> 00:42:00.400
Just wait a little longer.

00:42:02.119 --> 00:42:03.639
We've already waited a month.

00:42:04.119 --> 00:42:05.320
If we wait any longer,

00:42:06.184 --> 00:42:08.712
are we supposed to wait
until spring, when the ice melts

00:42:09.079 --> 00:42:10.159
and the weather warms up,

00:42:11.272 --> 00:42:12.960
before transport is no longer difficult?

00:42:18.599 --> 00:42:19.400
Fengtai,

00:42:19.704 --> 00:42:21.920
I'm truly not trying
to make things difficult for you.

00:42:24.159 --> 00:42:25.360
But I have to say,

00:42:25.760 --> 00:42:26.840
my superior

00:42:27.199 --> 00:42:28.679
is a disciple of Grand Secretary Zhao.

00:42:29.719 --> 00:42:31.239
Usually, you don't even need to ask

00:42:31.240 --> 00:42:32.990
for him to give you
priority in everything.

00:42:34.400 --> 00:42:36.199
But now that you and Young Lady Zhao...

00:42:40.960 --> 00:42:42.400
The rules from above have changed,

00:42:44.712 --> 00:42:46.472
and there's nothing I can do about it.

00:42:48.239 --> 00:42:48.880
Registrar Dai,

00:42:52.296 --> 00:42:55.000
the rough soldiers don't understand
the chain of command.

00:42:56.320 --> 00:42:57.400
When we lose our temper,

00:42:57.960 --> 00:43:00.079
we only know
how to take matters straight to the top.

00:43:05.180 --> 00:43:07.540
=Against the Current=
